      "show_in_quick_glance": true,
      "text": "<p>During&nbsp;this&nbsp;1&nbsp;month-long&nbsp;semester&nbsp;project,&nbsp;my&nbsp;team&nbsp;and&nbsp;I&nbsp;aimed&nbsp;to&nbsp;create&nbsp;a&nbsp;vertical&nbsp;slice&nbsp;of&nbsp;a&nbsp;detective-like&nbsp;game.&nbsp;For&nbsp;that,&nbsp;we&nbsp;focused&nbsp;on&nbsp;implementing&nbsp;all&nbsp;mechanics,&nbsp;a&nbsp;defined&nbsp;artstyle&nbsp;and&nbsp;a&nbsp;polished&nbsp;narrative.&nbsp;In&nbsp;the&nbsp;following&nbsp;video&nbsp;you&nbsp;can&nbsp;take&nbsp;a&nbsp;look&nbsp;at&nbsp;the&nbsp;first&nbsp;10&nbsp;minutes&nbsp;of&nbsp;gameplay,&nbsp;which&nbsp;showcase&nbsp;all&nbsp;of&nbsp;those&nbsp;elements.</p>",
