      "show_in_quick_glance": true,
      "text": "<p>As&nbsp;a&nbsp;level&nbsp;designer,&nbsp;I&nbsp;started&nbsp;by&nbsp;sketching&nbsp;a&nbsp;2d&nbsp;blueprint&nbsp;of&nbsp;what&nbsp;the&nbsp;barn&nbsp;would&nbsp;look&nbsp;like.&nbsp;After&nbsp;the&nbsp;first&nbsp;iteration,&nbsp;we&nbsp;decided&nbsp;to&nbsp;reduce&nbsp;the&nbsp;size&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;barn&nbsp;in&nbsp;order&nbsp;to&nbsp;suit&nbsp;better&nbsp;our&nbsp;scope.&nbsp;Finally,&nbsp;a&nbsp;more&nbsp;compacted&nbsp;version&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;barn&nbsp;was&nbsp;designed,&nbsp;where&nbsp;every&nbsp;character&nbsp;is&nbsp;placed&nbsp;in&nbsp;a&nbsp;certain&nbsp;position&nbsp;to&nbsp;fulfill&nbsp;game&nbsp;design&nbsp;purposes&nbsp;and&nbsp;follow&nbsp;the&nbsp;game&nbsp;narrative.</p>",
