      "text": "<p>I&nbsp;was&nbsp;also&nbsp;responsible&nbsp;of&nbsp;making&nbsp;the&nbsp;two&nbsp;blockouts&nbsp;for&nbsp;each&nbsp;one&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;blueprints&nbsp;in&nbsp;Unity.&nbsp;Doing&nbsp;the&nbsp;first&nbsp;blockout&nbsp;is&nbsp;what&nbsp;made&nbsp;us&nbsp;realize&nbsp;that&nbsp;the&nbsp;dimensions&nbsp;were&nbsp;too&nbsp;large.&nbsp;Then,&nbsp;I&nbsp;quickly&nbsp;iterated&nbsp;over&nbsp;it&nbsp;to&nbsp;create&nbsp;our&nbsp;second&nbsp;and&nbsp;final&nbsp;version,&nbsp;which&nbsp;preserves&nbsp;all&nbsp;necessary&nbsp;areas&nbsp;with&nbsp;reduced&nbsp;space.</p>",
