      "after_image": null,
      "show_in_quick_glance": true,
      "text": "<p>In&nbsp;order&nbsp;to&nbsp;help&nbsp;us&nbsp;structure&nbsp;the&nbsp;placement&nbsp;of&nbsp;hints,&nbsp;objects&nbsp;and&nbsp;the&nbsp;overall&nbsp;progress&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;game,&nbsp;I&nbsp;followed&nbsp;Richard&nbsp;Lemarchand&#39;s&nbsp;Game&nbsp;Design&nbsp;Macro&nbsp;template&nbsp;to&nbsp;create&nbsp;a&nbsp;macro&nbsp;chart&nbsp;that&nbsp;would&nbsp;serve&nbsp;as&nbsp;a&nbsp;guide&nbsp;for&nbsp;all&nbsp;the&nbsp;team&nbsp;to&nbsp;understand&nbsp;the&nbsp;flow&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;game.&nbsp;As&nbsp;it&nbsp;can&nbsp;be&nbsp;seen&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;file,&nbsp;our&nbsp;game&nbsp;is&nbsp;internally&nbsp;divided&nbsp;by&nbsp;phases&nbsp;and&nbsp;the&nbsp;player&nbsp;must&nbsp;achieve&nbsp;all&nbsp;Player&nbsp;Goals&nbsp;in&nbsp;a&nbsp;phase&nbsp;to&nbsp;progress&nbsp;to&nbsp;the&nbsp;next&nbsp;one.</p>",
