      "after_image": null,
      "show_in_quick_glance": true,
      "text": "<p>In&nbsp;a&nbsp;detective-like&nbsp;game,&nbsp;dialogues&nbsp;play&nbsp;a&nbsp;very&nbsp;important&nbsp;role.&nbsp;Moreover,&nbsp;Mitzi&#39;s&nbsp;ability&nbsp;to&nbsp;possess&nbsp;other&nbsp;characters&nbsp;added&nbsp;up&nbsp;some&nbsp;complexity&nbsp;to&nbsp;it.&nbsp;We&nbsp;had&nbsp;to&nbsp;find&nbsp;a&nbsp;way&nbsp;to&nbsp;organize&nbsp;and&nbsp;structure&nbsp;all&nbsp;dialogues.&nbsp;So&nbsp;similarly,&nbsp;I&nbsp;created&nbsp;a&nbsp;Narrative&nbsp;Macro&nbsp;that&nbsp;helped&nbsp;us&nbsp;classify&nbsp;and&nbsp;structure&nbsp;them.&nbsp;There,&nbsp;we&nbsp;were&nbsp;able&nbsp;to&nbsp;see&nbsp;all&nbsp;possible&nbsp;dialogues,&nbsp;from&nbsp;every&nbsp;controllable&nbsp;character&nbsp;at&nbsp;any&nbsp;given&nbsp;phase&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;game.</p>",
