      "after_image": null,
      "show_in_quick_glance": true,
      "text": "<p>To&nbsp;dabble&nbsp;into&nbsp;a&nbsp;bit&nbsp;of&nbsp;programming&nbsp;I&nbsp;designed&nbsp;and&nbsp;implemented&nbsp;a&nbsp;dialogue&nbsp;system&nbsp;that&nbsp;adapted&nbsp;to&nbsp;our&nbsp;project&nbsp;needs,&nbsp;parsing&nbsp;through&nbsp;.txt&nbsp;files&nbsp;that&nbsp;contain&nbsp;our&nbsp;dialogues.&nbsp;The&nbsp;dialogues&nbsp;contain&nbsp;symbols&nbsp;like&nbsp;&quot;+&quot;,&nbsp;&quot;-&quot;&nbsp;or&nbsp;&quot;&gt;&quot;&nbsp;that&nbsp;help&nbsp;our&nbsp;parser&nbsp;to&nbsp;identify&nbsp;different&nbsp;parts&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;dialogues&nbsp;and&nbsp;create&nbsp;appropiate&nbsp;data&nbsp;structures&nbsp;to&nbsp;display&nbsp;them.</p>",
