      "after_image": null,
      "show_in_quick_glance": true,
      "text": "<p>As&nbsp;a&nbsp;narrative&nbsp;designer,&nbsp;I&nbsp;also&nbsp;took&nbsp;care&nbsp;of&nbsp;creating&nbsp;a&nbsp;background&nbsp;story&nbsp;for&nbsp;each&nbsp;character,&nbsp;giving&nbsp;them&nbsp;different&nbsp;personalities&nbsp;that&nbsp;aligned&nbsp;with&nbsp;our&nbsp;humorous&nbsp;goal.&nbsp;At&nbsp;the&nbsp;same&nbsp;time,&nbsp;I&nbsp;thought&nbsp;about&nbsp;a&nbsp;motive&nbsp;for&nbsp;each&nbsp;of&nbsp;them&nbsp;as&nbsp;we&nbsp;wanted&nbsp;the&nbsp;player&nbsp;to&nbsp;struggle&nbsp;to&nbsp;clearly&nbsp;identify&nbsp;who&nbsp;could&nbsp;have&nbsp;stole&nbsp;the&nbsp;scarf.&nbsp;At&nbsp;the&nbsp;same&nbsp;time,&nbsp;this&nbsp;narrative&nbsp;design&nbsp;was&nbsp;used&nbsp;to&nbsp;inform&nbsp;the&nbsp;3d&nbsp;design&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;characters.</p>",
