  "title": "A Batective Story: the Stolen Scarf",
  "screenshots": [],
  "contributions": "<p>A&nbsp;Batective&nbsp;Story&nbsp;is&nbsp;a&nbsp;<strong>vertical&nbsp;slice</strong>&nbsp;of&nbsp;a&nbsp;humorous&nbsp;detective&nbsp;game&nbsp;built&nbsp;around&nbsp;<em>possession&nbsp;</em>as&nbsp;a&nbsp;<strong>core&nbsp;mechanic</strong>.&nbsp;Players&nbsp;control&nbsp;Mitzi,&nbsp;a&nbsp;bat&nbsp;who&nbsp;can&nbsp;bite&nbsp;and&nbsp;temporarily&nbsp;take&nbsp;over&nbsp;the&nbsp;body&nbsp;of&nbsp;other&nbsp;animals.&nbsp;In&nbsp;this&nbsp;project,&nbsp;I&nbsp;took&nbsp;care&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;level&nbsp;and&nbsp;narrative&nbsp;design,&nbsp;the&nbsp;shaders,&nbsp;and&nbsp;the&nbsp;implementation&nbsp;of&nbsp;a&nbsp;dialogue&nbsp;system&nbsp;from&nbsp;scratch.</p>",
